# Add project specific R8 rules here.
# AGP will combine all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules to pass to R8
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# If your project uses WebView with JS, uncomment the following
# and specify the fully qualified class name to the JavaScript interface
# class:
#-keepclassmembers class fqcn.of.javascript.interface.for.webview {
#   public *;
#}

# Navigation route args (Routes.kt) are primitives only: the selected Period is
# passed as a String token (Period.encode()/decodePeriod()), so no app class
# needs keeping here. If an enum or @Serializable class is ever added as a
# route arg, add -keepnames/-keepclassmembers for its fully-qualified name:
# Navigation-Compose resolves it by class name at NavHost setup time for every
# destination in the graph, and R8 renaming it crashes the whole nav graph.
